# Issue #104, own-ground (Round 22; moved here from the option pool by Round 26): "the How owner
# cannot deploy a change without a manual cache purge". Framed by the How owner at oG from its own
# record, it enters at o1b without o2a. Only its charter is recorded: it has not reached o13, so no
# DORA query reads it.
r:o4-104 a lc:Occurrence ; lc:atAct m:o4 ; lc:issue 104 ;
  lc:address [ a lc:Address ; lc:surfaceRead lc:SessionBranch ; lc:changeLocus lc:How ; lc:authorityRead lc:NoAuthority ] ;
  lc:readsIssuePosition 0 ; lc:readsHead "0000000000000000000000000000000000000005" ;
